OL,3,GNEWSABat with broken wing treated with
OL,4,Alaser therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bat found with a broken wing has
OL,7,Freceived laser therapy to help it
OL,8,Frecover.
OL,10,FThe serotine bat was found by a member
OL,11,Fof the public on a kerb in Witney,
OL,12,FOxfordshire, and taken to Tiggywinkles
OL,13,FWildlife Hospital in Haddenham,
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,16,FAfter having its wing repaired, the bat
OL,17,Fwas given pain relief, antibiotics and
OL,18,Flaser therapy to help it heal.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
