OL,3,GNEWSABat with broken wing treated with
OL,4,Alaser therapy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead vet Steve Smith said: "Once we're
OL,7,Fconfident the wing is strong enough,
OL,8,Fwe'll begin test flights to rebuild its
OL,9,Fstrength and make sure it is ready to
OL,10,Fcope back in the wild."
